    {
      "id": "lEQa",
      "code_hash": "9cb6bc10e23c2cb1fa224d798ce555db",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Physical cut momenta and identical photons</strong></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The table gives the sign in <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(K(0)=\\eta k_1||)</marimo-tex>. Cut propagator denominators\nbelong to the phase-space measure and are omitted from the squared\namplitude. The two forward topologies identify the identical cut photons;\nadding the <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(t\\leftrightarrow u||)</marimo-tex> assignment restores the fully labeled result.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This labeled squared amplitude has no final-state <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(1/2!||)</marimo-tex> factor. The\n<a href=\"/?file=hep/diphoton.py\">ordinary-amplitude notebook</a> includes that factor\nwhen integrating an event rate over both photon labels.</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='lEQa-0' random-id='74dafec4-407e-d603-8c92-061647482f73'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;Coordinate&#92;&quot;:1,&#92;&quot;Diagram&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;FK0&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Cut edge&#92;&quot;:3,&#92;&quot;K(0) / k1&#92;&quot;:-1},{&#92;&quot;Coordinate&#92;&quot;:1,&#92;&quot;Diagram&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;FK1&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Cut edge&#92;&quot;:3,&#92;&quot;K(0) / k1&#92;&quot;:-1},{&#92;&quot;Coordinate&#92;&quot;:2,&#92;&quot;Diagram&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;FK0&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Cut edge&#92;&quot;:4,&#92;&quot;K(0) / k1&#92;&quot;:-1},{&#92;&quot;Coordinate&#92;&quot;:2,&#92;&quot;Diagram&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;FK1&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Cut edge&#92;&quot;:4,&#92;&quot;K(0) / k1&#92;&quot;:-1}]&quot;' data-total-rows='4' data-total-columns='4' data-max-columns='50' data-banner-text='&quot;&quot;' data-pagination='false' data-page-size='10' data-show-filters='false' data-show-download='true' data-show-search='true' data-show-column-summaries='false' data-show-data-types='true' data-show-page-size-selector='false' data-show-column-explorer='true' data-show-chart-builder='true' data-row-headers='[]' data-hidden-columns='[]' data-has-stable-row-id='false' data-lazy='false' data-preload='false'></marimo-table></marimo-ui-element></div>"
          }
        }
      ],
