          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Spin-averaged labeled squared amplitude</strong></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-2\u00b7ee\u2074\n    \u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>-t\u00b7u\u00b3+7\u00b7Me\u00b2\u00b7t\u00b7u\u00b2+7\u00b7Me\u00b2\u00b7t\u00b2\u00b7u+Me\u00b2\u00b7t\u00b3+Me\u00b2\u00b7u\u00b3-14\u00b7Me\u2074\u00b7t\u00b7u-3\u00b7Me\u2074\u00b7t\u00b2\n        -3\u00b7Me\u2074\u00b7u\u00b2+6\u00b7Me\u2078-t\u00b3\u00b7u\n    <span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>/<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>t-Me\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\u00b2\u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>-u+Me\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Exact difference from the reference</strong></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">0</div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">With <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(e=m_e=1||)</marimo-tex>, <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(t=-1||)</marimo-tex>, <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(u=-7||)</marimo-tex> (hence <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(s=10||)</marimo-tex>), the massive physical\nresult is <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(83/8||)</marimo-tex>. Ward projections vanish. In the massless limit,\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\overline{|\\mathcal M|^2}=2e^4(t/u+u/t)||)</marimo-tex> and <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(s=8||)</marimo-tex> at the same <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(t,u||)</marimo-tex>.</span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">83/8</div></div>"
          }
        }
